OL,3,GNEWSARichard Tice sets out Reform UK's
OL,4,Apitch to London
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this week he spoke to Reform
OL,7,FUK's deputy leader Richard Tice MP and
OL,8,Fasked about their performance in May's
OL,9,Flocal elections and the party's
OL,10,Fprospects in London at the next mayoral
OL,11,Felection in 2028.
OL,13,FThis interview was recorded before
OL,14,Freports about donations to the party
OL,15,Fwere published on Friday.
